<title>SPAIN: Spain's Tabacalera Q1 attributable up 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Tabacalera Q1 attributable up 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the group for the first quarter of 1997, in billions of pesetas unless stated:</p>
<p>					  Q197	    Q196</p>
<p>    Attributable		   4.060	    3.794</p>
<p>    Net profit		     4.057	    3.756</p>
<p>    Pretax profit		  5.647	    5.370</p>
<p>    Ordinary results	     5.709	    4.406</p>
<p>    Sale of tobacco, stamps  203.597	  150.509</p>
<p>    Net turnover		  76.525	   69.729</p>
<p>    Net revenues		  78.108	   79.120</p>
<p>    Operating results	    3.113	     .328</p>
<p>NOTE - In a statement, the company stressed the higher volume of sales and higher gross margin.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
